":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSuggestionChip","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSSuggestionChip"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSSuggestionChip"}],"title":"OUDSSuggestionChip","role":"symbol"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\